WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.270
You don't need expensive software to make good designs.

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:09.011
Canva has templates for posters and social posts, on phone and web.

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:13.743
Figma, Inkscape and GIMP are powerful free options on a computer.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:19.019
Change templates to fit your message: your colours, photos and words.

00:00:19.570 --> 00:00:24.334
Use your own photos, or free sites like Unsplash, and check each licence.

00:00:24.880 --> 00:00:36.536
Before you move on, check: Create an account on one free tool. Customise a template with your own content. Use only images you are allowed to use.

00:00:37.290 --> 00:00:39.047
In the next lesson: Portfolio.
